## Public Content API

- [Public page metadata endpoint](https://www.mentimeter.com/api/markdown-pages): List public Markdown snapshot page metadata. Valid page categories: story, template, uncategorized. Do not call the endpoint without a category query parameter.
- [Public page metadata example](https://www.mentimeter.com/api/markdown-pages?category=story&locale=en-US&limit=100&skip=0): Example request for a supported page category.
